# s81_sticky_table_loqo prereg stub, frozen 2026-10-18 03:33:45 PDT (clock read with date) by voynich-08 subagent, before any real-data run.
# Fixture (--s81-fixture, synthetic line_sticky p=0.75 Latin manuscript, 8 quires): PASS (run 2; run 1 FAIL -> fixed before freeze:
#   P4/P5 re-centred in fixture only; C2 reference = manuscript full-text s69 pattern instead of same-fold calls).
#   fixture: line_sticky75|latin C1 6/8 C2 5/8 C3 within; default|latin C1 1/8 C2 0/8. Caveat: C1 also true for line_lock and page_sticky_fit on the fixture (C1 alone has low specificity among sticky variants; C2 separates).
# CALLS:
# C1 (primary, s71/s67 rule): a variant PREDICTS held-out quires iff it scores >=5/6 predictions (P1 P2 P3 P4 P5 P7, S67.score_model, N_DRAW 500) on >=8/15 folds on all three transliterations (ZL3b, RF1b, IT2a).
# C2: a variant reproduces the s69 call pattern iff its per-fold (C1,C2,C3p,C4p,C5) equal the manuscript's full-text s69 pattern on >=8/15 folds per transliteration (all three).
# C3: a variant's s55 distance to Voynich is within Voynich's own split-to-split 95% range: median d(variant split i, Voynich split j!=i) <= 97.5th pct of Voynich d(split i, split j), 30 splits, each transliteration.
# READINGS: C1 true for any sticky variant -> 'per-line table cipher predicts the manuscript'; else C2 false for every line-sticky variant (line_sticky75, line_sticky_fit x Latin, Italian) -> 'call-pattern match in s71 does not survive LOQO'; else -> 'matches the slot layer, misses the rest' (name failing predictions; C3 false named among what it misses).
# Variants: default p=0; line_sticky75 p=.75 line reset; line_sticky_fit; line_lock p=1; page_sticky_fit; page_lock p=1 (page reset); x CREMMA Latin, Dante Italian. p fitted on training quires only (lag-1 prefix gain, inner 80/20).
